"""A2A daemon wrapping a local agent CLI (claude / gemini / codex / kimi).

Usage: a2a-agentd <agent-name>

Agent names, ports and adapter kinds come from ~/.config/a2a-agents/agents.toml.
Each daemon serves the A2A protocol on 127.0.0.1:<port>, guarded by a shared
key (~/.config/a2a-agents/api-key, header X-API-Key) so other local users
cannot drive the agents. A2A context ids map to native CLI session ids,
persisted in ~/.local/state/a2a-agents/<agent>.json.
"""
